<% content_for :page_title, @locale == "en" ? "Link not valid — Vittio" : "Enlace no válido — Vittio" %>

<%= render "shared/marketing_header" %>

<main>
  <div class="container blog-article-container">
    <header class="blog-article-head">
      <h1 class="blog-article-title" data-lang-es>Este enlace ya no es válido</h1>
      <h1 class="blog-article-title" data-lang-en data-lang-en-block>This link is no longer valid</h1>
    </header>

    <article class="blog-prose">
      <p data-lang-es>
        Puede que la cuenta ya no exista. Si sigues recibiendo correos que no
        pediste, escríbenos a <a href="mailto:<%= support_email %>"><%= support_email %></a>
        y los detenemos manualmente.
      </p>
      <p data-lang-en data-lang-en-block>
        The account may no longer exist. If you're still getting email you didn't
        ask for, write to <a href="mailto:<%= support_email %>"><%= support_email %></a>
        and we'll stop it by hand.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</main>
